    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I, Ravindra Samaraweera, Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations do by virtue of the powersvested in me by Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon(1956 Revised Edition), as amended by Acts, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial disputes-SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Mr. S. G. Sooriyaarachchi, No. 22/1, Sri Pemarathana Mawatha, Menikdiwela tobe the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration.",
